{"articleNo":"2550","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2550&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 후기 대학원(일반,산업 및 교육) 학위논문 완성본 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.01","hit":"11170","attachments":[{"name":"학위논문작성법.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2550&attachNo=1741"},{"name":"영문요약 및 국문요약 양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2550&attachNo=1742"},{"name":"저작물이용허락서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2550&attachNo=1910"},{"name":"CD또는디스켓라벨형식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2550&attachNo=2015"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<font size=\"4\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"484\" bgcolor=\"#ffff99\" height=\"53\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">2009학년도 후기 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육) </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">학위논문 완성본 제출 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">2009학년도 후기 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육) 학위논문 완성본 제출에&nbsp;<br><br>관한 사항을 안내하오니 학위논문 심사에 합격하신 2009학년도 후기 학위수<br><br>여 예정자 분들(2010. 08.)께서는 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br><br><br><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">1. 제출 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">2010.07.14(수) ~16(금) [3일간]</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">2. 제출 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">3. 제출 서류</font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 완성본 논문 -하드바운드 또는 소프트바운드 6부 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (첨부의 학위논문 작성법 참고)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. CD 또는 디스켓 (라벨부착)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 완성본 논문 전체 수록분</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 140pt; TEXT-INDENT: -140pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"> 국문논문은 영문요약(초록) 수록분이 포함되어 있어야 하며,</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 140pt; TEXT-INDENT: -140pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;외국어논문은 국문요약(320자이내) 수록분이 포함되어 있어야 함</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 165pt; TEXT-INDENT: -165pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 논문 표지 및 인준 페이지</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 165pt; TEXT-INDENT: -165pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">논문표지 복사본 1부 및 심사위원 날인된 인준서 페이지 복사본 1부.</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 203.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -203.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 저작물 이용 허락서 (학위논문 이용 동의서)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 203.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -203.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">3. 유의사항</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 논문심사 결과보고서의 제목과 완성본 논문 제목이 동일하여야 함.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;(원스톱 서비스 학적- 논문내역 상 논문제목 확인 후 완성본 제작)</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 349.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -349.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 겉표지 및 인준서 상 대학원명 표기가 올바로 되어 있어야 함.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 109.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -109.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 요약본 누락 주의</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">(국문논문은 영문초록이 수록되어 있어야 하며, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">외국어 논문은 국문요약본이 수록되어 있어야 함)</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: right\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: right\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: right\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">2010. 06.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육)장</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n</font>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
